466: // ───────────────────────────────── CLI fallback (7z · rar · tar · xz) ─────────────────────────────────
467: // The native ZIP engine above is dependency-free; everything else shells out to the best
468: // available tool so "browse" and "extract" keep working, with real progress where possible.
